#: docs/silkie/install.rst:2
msgid "Install Silkie"
msgstr "安装 Silkie"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:4
msgid ""
"Silkie is built from the `silkie branch <https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/tree/silkie>`_ of"
" this repository. The installed executable is ``silkie``; its companion tools use ``silkie-"
"kitten``. Upstream kitty packages provide upstream kitty rather than Silkie's extensions."
msgstr ""
"Silkie 从本仓库的 `silkie 分支 <https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/tree/silkie>`_ 构建。安装后的可执行文件为 "
"``silkie``，配套工具使用 ``silkie-kitten``。上游 kitty 软件包提供上游 kitty，不包含 Silkie 的扩展。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:11
msgid "Binary packages"
msgstr "二进制软件包"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:13
msgid "Install on a supported macOS, Ubuntu, Debian, or Kylin system::"
msgstr "在支持的 macOS、Ubuntu、Debian 或麒麟系统上安装：::"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:17
msgid ""
"The installer explains which Goblin Reactor package source it needs and asks for permission "
"before adding or changing it. It reuses an existing matching source, verifies the APT signing "
"key, and installs ``silkie`` with Homebrew or APT. Source approval is read from your terminal, so"
" it also works when the script is piped to Bash. macOS needs Apple Silicon and macOS 26 or newer;"
" Homebrew is installed with your permission if it is missing."
msgstr ""
"安装脚本会说明所需的 Goblin Reactor 软件源，并在添加或修改之前征求许可。它会复用已有且匹配的软件源，验证 APT 签名密钥，再通过 Homebrew 或 APT 安装 "
"``silkie``。许可确认从终端读取，因此将脚本通过管道传给 Bash 时也能使用。macOS 需要 Apple Silicon 和 macOS 26 或更新版本；若未安装 "
"Homebrew，脚本会征得许可后安装。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:24
msgid "The manual commands are below."
msgstr "手动安装命令如下。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:26
msgid "On Apple Silicon with macOS 26 Tahoe, install the Homebrew cask::"
msgstr "在运行 macOS 26 Tahoe 的 Apple Silicon 机器上，安装 Homebrew cask：::"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:31
msgid ""
"The application requires macOS approval before first launch. The `Homebrew repository's Silkie "
"instructions <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ explain app approval and the available "
"release."
msgstr ""
"首次启动应用前，需要在 macOS 中批准运行。`Homebrew 仓库的 Silkie 安装说明 <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ "
"介绍了批准步骤和可用版本。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:35
msgid ""
"For Linux, the `signed APT repository <https://apt.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ provides "
"installation instructions, the signing key, and the repository entry for your distribution. "
"Current targets include Ubuntu 26.04 on amd64 and arm64, and Kylin V10 SP1 on old-world "
"LoongArch64 (``loongarch64``). Packages for Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 13 on amd64 are also listed "
"there. Use the suite matching your system; old-world ``loongarch64`` and new-world ``loong64`` "
"are different binary targets."
msgstr ""
"Linux 的 `已签名 APT 仓库 <https://apt.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ 提供安装说明、签名密钥和各发行版的软件源配置。当前目标包括 "
"Ubuntu 26.04 的 amd64 和 arm64，以及旧世界 LoongArch64（``loongarch64``）的麒麟 V10 SP1。仓库还列出了 Ubuntu 24.04 和 "
"Debian 13 的 amd64 软件包。请选择与系统匹配的发行套件；旧世界 ``loongarch64`` 和新世界 ``loong64`` 是不同的二进制目标。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:43
msgid "After configuring the repository as described there::"
msgstr "按上述说明配置软件源后：::"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:48
msgid "Launch ``silkie`` and use ``silkie-kitten`` for its companion tools."
msgstr "运行 ``silkie`` 启动终端，使用 ``silkie-kitten`` 运行配套工具。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:50
msgid "To check the installed commands::"
msgstr "检查已安装的命令：::"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:56
msgid ""
"The Linux repository signatures, package checksums, and executable links were checked for all "
"five targets listed above on October 28, 2026. APT installation and native-module loading were "
"also tested on Ubuntu 26.04 amd64 (``naamah``) and Kylin V10 SP1 LoongArch64 (``loongson``)."
msgstr ""
"2026 年 10 月 28 日，已检查上述五个目标的 Linux 仓库签名、软件包校验和以及可执行文件链接。还在 Ubuntu 26.04 amd64（``naamah``）和麒麟 V10 "
"SP1 LoongArch64（``loongson``）上测试了 APT 安装与原生模块加载。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:60
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Silkie Sprint and Silkie Scramble games <games>` are distributed as separate Homebrew "
"and APT packages. Their game page includes installation commands, supported platforms, controls, "
"and gameplay videos."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Silkie Sprint 和 Silkie Scramble 游戏 <games>` 以独立的 Homebrew 和 APT "
"软件包分发。游戏页面包含安装命令、支持的平台、操作方法和实机视频。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:65
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "字体"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:67
msgid ""
"Install Iosevka for Silkie's default text and Iosevka Slab for the serif role. For CJK text, "
"install a regional Sarasa Term or Noto Sans CJK family. Font files are separate from the "
"application; when a preferred font is absent, the operating system substitutes an available face."
" The :doc:`font-protocol` reference links the font sources and explains regional glyph selection."
msgstr ""
"安装 Iosevka 以使用 Silkie 的默认文本字体，安装 Iosevka Slab 以使用衬线字体角色。中日韩文本可安装相应地区的 Sarasa Term 或 Noto Sans CJK"
" 字体。字体文件与应用分开提供；首选字体缺失时，操作系统会替换为可用字体。:doc:`font-protocol` 列出了字体来源，并说明了地区字形的选择方式。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:74
msgid "Source builds"
msgstr "从源码构建"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:77
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置依赖"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:79
msgid ""
"Install Git, a C compiler, and `Go <https://go.dev/doc/install>`_. The minimum Go version is "
"declared in `go.mod on the silkie branch "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/blob/silkie/go.mod>`_."
msgstr ""
"安装 Git、C 编译器和 `Go <https://go.dev/doc/install>`_。Go 的最低版本在 `silkie 分支的 go.mod "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/blob/silkie/go.mod>`_ 中声明。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:112
msgid ""
"Building the native SVG renderer also requires Cargo and "
"`Rust <https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install>`_ 1.87 or later. Cargo downloads the locked SVG "
"dependencies on the first source build."
msgstr ""
"构建原生 SVG 渲染器还需要 Cargo 和 `Rust <https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install>`_ 1.87 或更高版本。"
"首次从源码构建时，Cargo 会下载锁定版本的 SVG 依赖。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:83
msgid ""
"On macOS, install Apple's command line developer tools with ``xcode-select --install`` if they "
"are not already available. On Linux, install the X11 and D-Bus development libraries listed in "
"`kitty's build prerequisites <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/build/#x11-dev-libs>`_."
msgstr ""
"在 macOS 上，若尚未安装 Apple 命令行开发工具，请运行 ``xcode-select --install``。在 Linux 上，安装 `kitty 构建前置条件 "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/build/#x11-dev-libs>`_ 列出的 X11 和 D-Bus 开发库。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:88
msgid ""
"The ``dev.sh`` build uses prebuilt dependencies for the supported platform, including its Python "
"environment. The first build needs network access and downloads those dependencies. The `build "
"implementation <https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/blob/silkie/bypy/devenv.go>`_ is in this "
"repository. For a build against system libraries, consult the `upstream dependency list "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/build/#dependencies>`_ and Silkie's `Brewfile "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/blob/silkie/Brewfile>`_ on macOS."
msgstr ""
"``dev.sh`` 使用支持平台的预构建依赖，包括 Python 环境。首次构建需要联网下载这些依赖。`构建实现 "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/blob/silkie/bypy/devenv.go>`_ 位于本仓库中。若要使用系统库构建，请参阅 "
"`上游依赖列表 <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/build/#dependencies>`_；macOS 还可参阅 Silkie 的 `Brewfile "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/silkie/blob/silkie/Brewfile>`_。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:98
msgid "Build and launch"
msgstr "构建与启动"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:100
msgid ""
"The macOS dependency setup uses loader-relative library references so checkout paths do not "
"overflow the downloaded libraries' Mach-O load commands. Setup is retried automatically if an "
"earlier download or relocation was incomplete. A fresh checkout with this fix completed the build"
" and native-module loading checks on October 28, 2026."
msgstr ""
"macOS 的依赖配置使用相对于加载器的库引用，避免检出路径超出已下载库的 Mach-O 加载命令空间。如果上次下载或重定位不完整，会自动重试配置。2026 年 10 月 28 "
"日，包含此修复的全新检出版本已通过构建和原生模块加载检查。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:108
msgid ""
"Keep the checkout in place when running this development build. Re-run ``./dev.sh build`` after "
"changing the source. Development builds use the internal ``kitty/launcher/kitty`` and "
"``kitty/launcher/kitten`` paths rather than the installed ``silkie`` and ``silkie-kitten`` "
"commands. On macOS, the build also supplies ``kitty/launcher/kitty.app``; see the `upstream build"
" notes <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/build/>`_ for details about unsigned applications and "
"relocating a checkout."
msgstr ""
"运行开发构建时，请保留检出目录。修改源码后重新运行 ``./dev.sh build``。开发构建使用内部路径 ``kitty/launcher/kitty`` 和 "
"``kitty/launcher/kitten``，而不是安装后的 ``silkie`` 与 ``silkie-kitten`` 命令。在 macOS 上，构建还提供 "
"``kitty/launcher/kitty.app``；未签名应用和移动检出目录的说明见 `上游构建文档 <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/build/>`_。"

