msgstr "Linux：::"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:131
msgid ""
"The :doc:`show_pointer kitten <show-pointer>` queries the input protocols and displays the events"
" supported by the terminal and connected devices."
msgstr ":doc:`show_pointer 工具 <show-pointer>` 会查询输入协议，并显示终端和已连接设备支持的事件。"

#: docs/silkie/install.rst:135
msgid ""
"Next, read :doc:`configuration` for Silkie-specific options and the `kitty configuration manual "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/conf/>`_ for the inherited settings. Applications should query "
":doc:`capabilities-protocol` before enabling extensions."
msgstr ""
"接下来，阅读 :doc:`configuration` 了解 Silkie 专有选项，参阅 `kitty 配置手册 "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/conf/>`_ 了解继承的设置。应用应在启用扩展之前查询 :doc:`capabilities-protocol`。"


# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "Install Silkie and Iosevka on a supported macOS, Ubuntu, Debian, or Kylin system::"
msgstr "在支持的 macOS、Ubuntu、Debian 或麒麟系统上安装 Silkie 和 Iosevka：::"

# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "The installer explains which Goblin Reactor package source it needs and asks for permission before adding or changing it. It reuses an existing matching source, verifies the APT signing key, and installs ``silkie`` with Homebrew or APT. It also installs the unmodified Iosevka font: the official Homebrew ``font-iosevka`` cask on macOS, or a checksum-verified upstream release on Linux. Source approval is read from your terminal, so it also works when the script is piped to Bash. macOS needs Apple Silicon and macOS 26 or newer; Homebrew is installed with your permission if it is missing."
msgstr "安装脚本会说明所需的 Goblin Reactor 软件源，并在添加或修改之前征求许可。它会复用匹配的现有软件源，验证 APT 签名密钥，并通过 Homebrew 或 APT 安装 ``silkie``。此外还会安装未经修改的 Iosevka 字体：macOS 使用官方 Homebrew ``font-iosevka`` cask，Linux 则下载并校验上游发布文件的校验和。软件源许可从终端读取，因此脚本通过管道传给 Bash 时也能使用。macOS 需要 Apple Silicon 和 macOS 26 或更高版本；如果缺少 Homebrew，脚本会征得许可后安装。"

# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "The installer includes Iosevka for Silkie's default text, using the wider Extended faces for regular, bold and italic text. For a manual font installation, use ``brew install --cask font-iosevka`` on macOS or download the unmodified fonts from `Iosevka's releases <https://github.com/be5invis/Iosevka/releases>`_ on Linux. The scripted Linux installation currently pins Iosevka 34.9.1."
msgstr "安装脚本包含 Silkie 默认文本使用的 Iosevka 字体；常规、粗体和斜体均使用较宽的 Extended 字形。手动安装时，macOS 可使用 ``brew install --cask font-iosevka``；Linux 可从 `Iosevka 发布页 <https://github.com/be5invis/Iosevka/releases>`_ 下载未经修改的字体。Linux 安装脚本目前固定使用 Iosevka 34.9.1。"

# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "Iosevka is copyright Renzhi Li and is distributed under the `SIL Open Font License 1.1 <https://github.com/be5invis/Iosevka/blob/main/LICENSE.md>`_. This license permits use, installation and bundling with software, provided the font retains its license and copyright notices; the font cannot be sold on its own. The installer downloads the original fonts without modifying or renaming them, and saves the matching ``Iosevka-LICENSE.md`` alongside the font files. The fonts remain licensed separately from Silkie."
msgstr "Iosevka 的版权属于 Renzhi Li，按 `SIL 开源字体许可证 1.1 <https://github.com/be5invis/Iosevka/blob/main/LICENSE.md>`_ 分发。该许可证允许使用、安装和随软件一起分发字体，前提是保留许可证与版权声明；字体不得单独出售。安装脚本下载原始字体，不修改或重命名字体，并将对应的 ``Iosevka-LICENSE.md`` 保存到字体文件旁。字体与 Silkie 采用各自独立的许可证。"

# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "To use Iosevka's narrower original width instead, configure::"
msgstr "如需使用 Iosevka 原来较窄的字宽，可配置：::"

# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "Install Iosevka Slab separately for the serif role. For CJK text, install a regional Sarasa Term or Noto Sans CJK family. Font files are separate from the application; when a preferred font is absent, the operating system substitutes an available face. The :doc:`font-protocol` reference links the font sources and explains regional glyph selection."
msgstr "衬线字体角色需要另行安装 Iosevka Slab。中日韩文本可安装相应地区的 Sarasa Term 或 Noto Sans CJK 字体。字体文件与应用分开提供；首选字体缺失时，操作系统会替换为可用字体。:doc:`font-protocol` 列出了字体来源，并说明了地区字形的选择方式。"

# Unsigned macOS app and installer dequarantine.
msgid "The macOS app is not signed with an Apple Developer ID or notarized, so the installer and the Homebrew cask clear its quarantine flag after installing it; otherwise macOS would refuse to open it."
msgstr "macOS 应用没有使用 Apple Developer ID 签名，也未经公证，因此安装脚本和 Homebrew cask 会在安装后清除它的隔离标记；否则 macOS 会拒绝打开它。"

# Unsigned macOS app and installer dequarantine.
msgid "The cask clears the app's quarantine flag after installing it. If macOS still blocks first launch, approve Silkie in System Settings > Privacy & Security, or run ``xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/silkie.app``. The `Homebrew repository's Silkie instructions <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ explain app approval and the available release."
msgstr "cask 会在安装后清除应用的隔离标记。如果 macOS 仍然阻止首次启动，请在“系统设置 > 隐私与安全性”中批准 Silkie，或运行 ``xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/silkie.app``。`Homebrew 仓库的 Silkie 安装说明 <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ 介绍了批准步骤和可用版本。"
